          "Jian66666"
        ],
        "description": "Relying on JD.com's massive e-commerce advertiser base, the JD Media platform provides media partners with high-quality commercialization solutions. It helps media quickly and autonomously access resources to efficiently display ads from JD advertisers, supporting various trading models that are flexible, independent, and transparent to maximize media resource monetization.",
